# Blender 5.3.0 MTL File: 'None'
# www.blender.org
# Texture maps removed (they pointed at files outside the repository); the
# engine shades with the diffuse colour Kd only.

# Receiver, barrel, sights: dark grey manganese-phosphate (parkerized) steel.
newmtl BaseMetal
Ka 0.596330 0.596330 0.596330
Kd 0.105000 0.105000 0.110000
Ks 0.500000 0.500000 0.500000
Ke 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
Ni 1.500000
d 1.000000
illum 3

# Magazine: grey hard-anodized aluminium, a shade lighter than the steel.
newmtl Clip
Ka 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Kd 0.180000 0.175000 0.165000
Ks 0.500000 0.500000 0.500000
Ke 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
Ni 1.500000
d 1.000000
illum 2

# Pistol grip and handguards: black glass-filled polymer.
newmtl Grip
