Kd 0.060000 0.060000 0.062000
Ks 0.500000 0.500000 0.500000
Ke 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
Ni 1.500000
d 1.000000
illum 2

# Suppressor: matte black high-temperature coating.
newmtl Silencer
